  "decision": "PASS / S-IWD-PROD-SP500-ROLE ROBUST_STRATEGY_PASS. IWD preserves the frozen V11 signal/target/event path and 100% gross while replacing only the realized sp500 role return from 2004-02-02 onward. Full CAGR 14.468031% vs V11 14.345615%, full Sharpe 1.542584 vs 1.522263, full MDD 7.689054% vs 7.689054%. On the post-substitution evaluation window, CAGR 14.727241% vs 14.594439% and Sharpe 1.555816 vs 1.533946. IWD passed 5/7 fold Sharpe comparisons, all deterministic gates, 20000-replicate paired block bootstrap with P(CAGR>V11)=90.985% and P(Sharpe>V11)=98.215%, MDD P97.5=13.193%, and cumulative 40-performance-candidate DSR=97.202%. VBR is rejected despite higher CAGR because it won only 4/7 fold Sharpe comparisons and P(Sharpe>V11)=81.965%<90%. No post-result blend/timing/start/ETF rescue is permitted. IWD is a retrospective robust strategy candidate, not a claim that G0-G6/prospective validation is complete; freeze it for prospective OOS before product promotion.",
